12
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:55.000
tool Internet Relay Chat, better known as IRC. IRC hosted thousands of chatrooms dedicated to a variety of topics, and it was here that Ronald Reaver began interacting with like-minded pedophiles. These interactions mostly occurred within two chatrooms, but members occasionally communicated directly through email. In early 1996, Reaver created a private, invitation-only chatroom titled Orchard Club, wherein members electronically distributed illicit images of children to one another under his leadership. The only way to join Orchard Club was to be recommended by an established member, with

