00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:52.000
of conspiracy to commit sexual exploitation of a minor, conspiracy to traffic in child pornography and sending and receiving pornographic images of children over the internet. Yet, he chose to plead not guilty for state charges relating to child molestation. Reaver's accomplice, Milton Myers, faced five counts of molestation, to which he plead guilty. Both men remained silent during court proceedings as their young survivors bravely took the stand. Allison chose to testify because she had learned not to blame herself for the abuse she endured and wanted to stand up for other children who were unable to speak for themselves.

